sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as test binary
    participant C as controller
    participant S as fork server
    participant R as runner
    participant B as shared memory
    Note over U,C: one process: --fuzz=S.P, CentipedeMain
    Note over S,R: same binary again, CENTIPEDE_RUNNER_FLAGS set
    U->>C: CentipedeFuzzerAdaptor::Run hands over control
    C->>S: launch the binary again as a runner
    S->>R: fork() a runner when one is needed, parent stays warm
    C->>B: write a batch of parent inputs, persistent runner takes batch after batch
    R->>R: Mutate: FuzzTest domains build the children
    R->>R: Execute: run the property on each input
    R->>B: per input: PCs, CMP, callstack, user features
    B-->>C: batch results
    C->>C: FeatureSet: new feature, keep input, weight by rarity
    alt a runner died or a property failed
        C->>R: re-run the batch one input at a time
        R-->>C: the input that reproduces
        C->>C: save crashes/sha1 and crash-metadata, exit_on_crash
    end
    Note over C,R: a crash kills a runner, never the controller
